Note on the underlying facts: the figures are public records — business
registry filings, annual reports, exchange filings and court records. The
licence covers this compilation, its field structure, its source notes and
its verification trail; it does not claim ownership of the underlying public
records. If a figure here disagrees with the primary source, the primary
source wins — send the document and page number and the record will be
corrected or blanked.
